winnow v0.2 distributable: spec, reference fold implementation, and hand-authored demo extraction.

The spec (winnow-spec-v0.2.md) is authoritative. fold.py is the reference implementation: parse .wno delta logs, fold into a materialized semantic graph, validate, and render views (digest, snapshot, query, yield curve). demo-deltas.wno is the spec section 11 reference extraction.

Usage: python3 fold.py LOG.wno [--digest|--snapshot|--yield-curve|--concepts|--stale N]


