Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="winnow-spec-v0.2.md"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
X-Aimpack-Checksum-SHA256: 329702deb5376919646d335eb952792a40195178c09df93f49a7a7fae2e7c2d9
